                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Func^R(C,D)
              corresponds to a functor
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
