              %p
            %p
              The two adjunctions in
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SliceAdjoints"}
              admit the following joint generalisation, which is proven
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Topos+Theory"} HTT, lem. 5.2.5.2
              = succeed ".)" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
