            %p This is clearly a homotopy pullback precisely if the top morphism is an equivalence.
          %p Using this, we get the following.
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition_7 Proposition
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
